# Risk-based review. GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so every path is
# owner-reviewed by default and only plain Markdown documentation is released
# from review. See docs/RISK-BASED-MERGE.md for the two repository settings the
# owner must apply for this file to take effect.
*                      @nskmedia

# Explicit high-risk paths (already covered by the default; listed so they can
# never be loosened by accident in a later edit).
/.github/              @nskmedia
/CLAUDE.md             @nskmedia
/SECURITY.md           @nskmedia
/releases/             @nskmedia
/scripts/              @nskmedia
/src/                  @nskmedia
/config/               @nskmedia
/package.json          @nskmedia
/package-lock.json     @nskmedia

# Low risk: Markdown under docs/ only (no code, workflows, policy or data files).
/docs/**/*.md
